<section class="two-up" id="rewards">
  <div class="reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">Lashtribe Points</div>
    <h3>Every order earns you something back.</h3>
    <p>
      Every transaction on the platform earns points, redeemable against
      your next preorder. The more you restock with us, the less your next
      batch costs.
    </p>
    <a href="#" class="btn-ghost" style="border-color:var(--charcoal);color:var(--black);"
      >How Points Work</a
    >
  </div>
  <div class="reveal d1">
    <div class="eyebrow">Private Label</div>
    <h3>Order 10+ units, make it yours.</h3>
    <p>
      Resellers ordering more than 10 units of a product can have it
      branded with their own label — your name on the box, our sourcing
      behind it.
    </p>
    <a href="#" class="btn-ghost" style="border-color:var(--charcoal);color:var(--black);"
      >Reseller Details</a
    >
  </div>
</section>
